<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR1a0171-ann"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Annotations for 五行大義</title></titleStmt><publicationStmt><p>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><p>Created by members of the TLS project</p></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation>Initially created: <date>2026-01-26T18:46:00.137+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Annotations</head><p xml:id="KR1a0171-start"><seg xml:id="KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p1s45"><line>天地之襲精爲陰陽、</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="COMBINE" concept-id="uuid-57bfb426-56b5-44b8-8b75-0f68077feea8" xml:id="uuid-18bdefe8-5496-4be6-bdef-e854964be66e"><link target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p1s45 #uuid-0e083a65-860f-4b1a-883a-65860f5b1a6b"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="五行大義" target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p1s45" pos="4">天地之襲精爲陰陽、</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of into (English)" transl-id="KR1a0171-en-bcf33efa" src="AI - Gemini">The coalesced essence of Heaven and Earth forms Yīn and Yáng.</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="" orig=""><orth>襲</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">xí</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-0e083a65-860f-4b1a-883a-65860f5b1a6b"><gramGrp><pos>V</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-fed035db-e7bd-4d23-bd05-9698b26e38f9">vadN</tls:syn-func></gramGrp><def>coalesced and integrated</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2026-01-26T18:46:00.137+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2026-01-26T18:46:00.137+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p1s46"><line>陰陽之專精爲四時、</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="CONCENTRATE" concept-id="uuid-d63759c9-e8a3-4ba3-803b-d3febf9acba3" xml:id="uuid-642cf625-294c-46ed-acf6-25294cb6edf6"><link target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p1s46 #uuid-7cb7e211-5860-48d8-b7e2-115860c8d83c"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="五行大義" target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p1s46" pos="4">陰陽之專精爲四時、</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of into (English)" transl-id="KR1a0171-en-bcf33efa" src="AI - Gemini">The concentrated essence of Yīn and Yáng forms the four seasons.</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-344be0b4-1d81-4931-8eeb-7f020f3849fe" orig=""><orth>專</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">zhuān</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-7cb7e211-5860-48d8-b7e2-115860c8d83c"><gramGrp><pos>V</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-fed035db-e7bd-4d23-bd05-9698b26e38f9">vadN</tls:syn-func><tls:sem-feat corresp="#uuid-6f2fab01-1156-4ed8-9b64-74c1e7455915">middle voice</tls:sem-feat></gramGrp><def>concentrated</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2026-01-26T18:47:33.73+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2026-01-26T18:47:33.73+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p2s5"><line>言春時出地之木、</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="ISSUE" concept-id="uuid-9791e09f-66ae-43f2-b3f6-a3989c2a30ca" xml:id="uuid-3c3271c8-11ca-47cd-b271-c811ca07cd42"><link target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p2s5 #uuid-60d59085-8ede-4b1d-9590-858ede1b1de2"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="五行大義" target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p2s5" pos="4">言春時出地之木、</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of into (English)" transl-id="KR1a0171-en-bcf33efa" src="AI - Gemini">This means that the trees emerging from the ground in springtime,</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-f80ca1bf-4e49-46a8-8a84-15bc02805b0b" orig=""><orth>出</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">chū</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-60d59085-8ede-4b1d-9590-858ede1b1de2"><gramGrp><pos>V</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-fbfb2371-2537-4a99-a876-41b15ec2463c">vtoN</tls:syn-func></gramGrp><def>come out from</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2026-01-26T18:50:30.774+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2026-01-26T18:50:30.774+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p2s28"><line>曲者中鉤。</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="CONFORM" concept-id="uuid-f9e3551f-7344-4e58-99fc-c99d8c3d3944" xml:id="uuid-a209b582-1497-4689-89b5-821497d68953"><link target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p2s28 #uuid-36020202-1f48-4372-b0fa-fd6b1a8e3874"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="五行大義" target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p2s28" pos="3">曲者中鉤。</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of into (English)" transl-id="KR1a0171-en-bcf33efa" src="AI - Gemini">and what is curved conforms to the carpenter's square.</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-1dd0a030-8192-419c-887b-e9d9a6007c80" orig=""><orth>中</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">zhòng</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-36020202-1f48-4372-b0fa-fd6b1a8e3874"><gramGrp>
                    <pos>V</pos>
  <tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-fbfb2371-2537-4a99-a876-41b15ec2463c">vtoN</tls:syn-func>
                    <usg type="warring-states-currency">4</usg>
                </gramGrp><def>correspond exactly to, be exactly appropriate for; be in conformity with</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2026-01-26T18:51:27.37+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2026-01-26T18:51:27.37+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p4s29"><line>如人君縱意、</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="UNRESTRAINED" concept-id="uuid-c4f93107-fffa-48b8-b468-e12e83bac180" xml:id="uuid-06516ed4-f643-4253-916e-d4f643725324"><link target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p4s29 #uuid-1d622e64-aafc-4978-a22e-64aafcf97831"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="五行大義" target="#KR1a0171_tls_01-d1d3p4s29" pos="4">如人君縱意、</tls:srcline><tls:line title="" transl-id="KR1a0171-en-bcf33efa" src=""/></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-f122ed33-efc0-4d38-8cde-8cf159f2deef #uuid-86e4a807-6fa6-4cba-82e7-b424cdf004e7" orig=""><orth>縱意</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">zōng yì</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-1d622e64-aafc-4978-a22e-64aafcf97831"><gramGrp><pos>V</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-091af450-64e0-4b82-98a2-84d0444b6d19">VPi</tls:syn-func></gramGrp><def>do as one likes; intellectually: seinen Gedanken freien Lauf lassen</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2026-01-26T22:17:31.237+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2026-01-26T22:17:31.237+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>